$$<p>The Odisha Adarsha Vidyalaya Sangathan (OAVS) opened applications on 12 October 2026 for 815 Principal and teacher posts in Odisha Adarsha Vidyalayas (OAVs) and Odisha Mining Adarsha Vidyalayas (OMAVs), under advertisement number 01/2026. The window closes on 11 November 2026 at 5:00 pm. The posts are regular appointments, not contract engagements — a distinction that carries real weight for job security, service conditions and retirement benefits.</p>
<p>The drive covers the full hierarchy of a school system in one advertisement: over 100 Principal posts, Post Graduate Teachers (PGT) across six subjects, Trained Graduate Teachers (TGT) as the largest group, plus Art Teachers, Physical Education Teachers (PET) and Computer Teachers. For candidates, the practical point is that a single application window serves both classroom posts and school leadership posts, with different qualifications and age limits for each. One honest limit on the figures in this article: the total of 815 is consistent across every published report, but subject-wise splits differ between secondary reports, so the detailed notification on oav.edu.in is the authoritative source for the split, and this article deliberately does not publish a split that conflicts with it.</p>
<h2>At a glance</h2>
